page('law.html','Tax & law','OFFICIAL RULES / 06','Current rules reviewed on the per-source dates shown below—not a promise of rules at a future inheritance.',notice('How to read this page','Every row is either a rule read on the linked official page in this session, or it says what is not verified. Displayed legal amounts are rounded to $10 where a fraction appears; the linked authority always governs. Rules can change before any transfer; re-read them at the time of action.')+table('Current rules · displayed legal dollars rounded to $10 where necessary; exact authority remains linked',['Topic','Verified rule / amount','Limits','Official source'],laws)+'''<h2>How much room remains?</h2><p>The remaining household exclusion and cash that could pass without federal estate tax are <b>unknown</b>. Do not subtract only a house value. The estate computation includes includible assets, prior taxable gifts, deductions, credits and any valid portability. Filing threshold and actual liability are different. Crossing a threshold is not itself a tax penalty; late filing/payment and tax liability are separate issues.</p>'''+notice('No fabricated household cash threshold','No estate inventory, prior-gift history, citizenship/residency determination, trust inclusion analysis or portability election has been verified. No local estate-tax threshold is established in this audit; local property, recording and sale charges are separate and parcel/transaction dependent. Current California Controller guidance is not a guarantee about every local charge.')+table('SYNTHETIC future exclusion sensitivity · not actual statutory indexing',['Year','Official future amount','0% assumed growth','2% assumed growth','4% assumed growth','Official starting authority'],future,'illustration')+'''<p>Arithmetic only: published 2027 exclusion × (1 + assumed rate)^(year − 2027). The 0% / 2% / 4% paths are invented, not IRS amounts or replicas of statutory rounding and CPI mechanics. Revisit at transfer; lower-exclusion legislation could reverse apparent headroom. No future estate tax calculation is represented as official.</p>''')

