page('flagged.html','Flagged for review','LIMITATIONS & SOURCE REGISTER / 08','Unverified does not mean false. It means the evidence does not support presenting a value as confirmed.',table('Published open items · non-blocking, with official context (not verification of private facts)',['Item','Status','Finding / consequence','Official context'],flags,'unverified')+notice('Public-site privacy has limits','This guide has no forms, scripts, analytics, external fonts or uploads. The repository itself is public and contains household-derived data outside this guide; Pages exclusions do not protect repository files. Your browser contacts source sites only when you follow their links; GitHub states that visitor IP addresses are logged for security purposes; see the GitHub source below. The repository remains a separate exposure surface. No private figures were imported into the new illustrative model.')+'''<h2>Verification method</h2><p>Every claim in this edition was re-read on its official page in the audit dated 13 November 2026, and three published statements were corrected as a result. The date beside each source is the applicable check date. Legal facts are distinguished from workflow judgments, missing records and illustrative assumptions. Each data row links to official context; a link is not evidence that the source certifies a forecast, expense or recommendation. Broken candidate URLs were rejected, including the old BOE Prop13 URL and an incorrect Investor.gov path. No live property searches were used.</p>'''+table('Source register · substantive claims checked in this session',['Official authority','Verified passage / scope','Checked','Direct source'],source_rows)+'''<h2>Delivery and completeness</h2><p>This edition supplies an executive brief, decision gates, current tax-law findings, a trust roadmap, operating-cost and history verification registers, annual synthetic calculations and black-swan illustrations. It deliberately does not claim a verified household forecast, exact future tax, binding insurance price, total remaining estate allowance, exhaustive pending-law search or guaranteed best investment. Review flags do not block publication; failures of the build or publication allowlist do.</p>''')

